---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a href="/" class="header-logo">
      <img src="/talon-logo.png" alt="Talon" class="logo-img" />
      <span class="logo-text">Talon</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="header-nav">
      <a href="#product" class="nav-link">Product</a>
      <a href="#how" class="nav-link">How it works</a>
      <a href="/resources" class="nav-link">Resources</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="header-right">
      <button class="btn-primary" onclick="document.getElementById('product-url').focus(); document.getElementById('analyzer').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
        Analyze your product <span class="arr">→</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero-split">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Your competitors are adjusting prices right now</div>
    <h1>Stop losing sales to competitor pricing.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Paste your URL. See what you're losing — and the exact price to set.</p>
    <div class="hero-icp">
      <span>Shopify stores</span>
      <span class="icp-div">·</span>
      <span>Amazon sellers</span>
      <span class="icp-div">·</span>
      <span>DTC brands</span>
    </div>
    <div class="analyzer-box" id="analyzer">
      <form class="analyzer-form" onsubmit="return handleSubmit(event)">
        <input type="url" id="product-url" class="analyzer-input" placeholder="https://yourstore.com/product" required />
        <button type="submit" class="analyzer-btn">Analyze →</button>
      </form>
      <p class="analyzer-note">No signup required · Results in seconds</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <div class="live-feed">
      <div class="feed-header">
        <span class="feed-title">Live Pricing Feed</span>
        <span class="feed-status"><span class="status-dot"></span> <span class="status-text">4 products</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="feed-item feed-item-red">
        <div class="feed-time">2 min ago</div>
        <div class="feed-store">NikeStore.com</div>
        <div class="feed-action">Dropped Air Force 1 '07 by 12%</div>
        <div class="feed-impact">Est. impact: <span class="impact-red">-$38/day</span></div>
        <div class="feed-suggestion"><span class="sug-label">Talon suggests:</span><span class="sug-action">Match to $109 →</span></div>
        <div class="feed-meta"><span class="conf">92% confidence</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="feed-item feed-item-green">
        <div class="feed-time">8 min ago</div>
        <div class="feed-store">FinishLine</div>
        <div class="feed-action">Raised Jordan 1 by 5%</div>
        <div class="feed-impact">Est. impact: <span class="impact-green">+$22/day</span></div>
        <div class="feed-suggestion"><span class="sug-label">Talon suggests:</span><span class="sug-action">Raise to $145 →</span></div>
        <div class="feed-meta"><span class="conf">87% confidence</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="feed-item feed-item-amber">
        <div class="feed-time">14 min ago</div>
        <div class="feed-store">StockX</div>
        <div class="feed-action">Supply squeeze detected - Yeezy 350</div>
        <div class="feed-impact">Market moving upward</div>
        <div class="feed-suggestion"><span class="sug-label">Talon suggests:</span><span class="sug-action">Increase stock before price jumps →</span></div>
        <div class="feed-meta"><span class="conf">78% confidence</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="feed-item feed-item-green">
        <div class="feed-time">32 min ago</div>
        <div class="feed-store">JD Sports</div>
        <div class="feed-action">Restocked Air Max 90</div>
        <div class="feed-impact">Est. impact: <span class="impact-green">+$15/day</span></div>
        <div class="feed-suggestion"><span class="sug-label">Talon suggests:</span><span class="sug-action">Raise to $165 →</span></div>
        <div class="feed-meta"><span class="conf">85% confidence</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-row" style="background:var(--bg1)">
  <div class="stat-item">
    <span class="stat-num">2,400+</span>
    <span class="stat-label">Stores analyzed</span>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-divider"></div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <span class="stat-num">&lt; 60s</span>
    <span class="stat-label">To first insight</span>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-divider"></div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <span class="stat-num">$1.2M</span>
    <span class="stat-label">Revenue protected</span>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="signal-stack-section">
  <div class="ss-wrap" id="ss-wrap">
    <span class="ss-item ss-active" data-idx="0"><span class="ss-arrow">→</span> PRICE DROP</span>
    <span class="ss-item" data-idx="1">SUPPLY SQUEEZE</span>
    <span class="ss-item" data-idx="2">POSITION LOSS</span>
    <span class="ss-item" data-idx="3">MARGIN WINDOW</span>
    <span class="ss-item" data-idx="4">NEW COMPETITOR</span>
  </div>
  <p class="ss-caption">Talon detects every signal. Tells you what to do with each one.</p>
</div>

<section class="logos-bar">
  <span class="logos-label">Works with</span>
  <div class="logos-track">
    <span>Shopify</span>
    <span>WooCommerce</span>
    <span>BigCommerce</span>
    <span>Magento</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how-it-works section-textured" id="how">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-tag">How it works</span>
    <h2>Three steps. One action.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">01</div>
      <div class="step-title">Paste your product</div>
      <div class="step-desc">Enter any product URL. Talon instantly maps your competitors and starts tracking.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">02</div>
      <div class="step-title">Detect pricing gaps</div>
      <div class="step-desc">See every competitor price change in real time. Know exactly where you stand.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">03</div>
      <div class="step-title">Get live actions</div>
      <div class="step-desc">Receive specific pricing recommendations with estimated revenue impact.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="problem-section" style="background:var(--bg0)">
  <div class="problem-content">
    <p class="problem-lead">Most stores don't lose money because of bad pricing.</p>
    <p class="problem-body">They lose money because they react too late. By the time you notice a competitor dropped their price, you've already lost the sale.</p>
    <div class="problem-punch">The sale is gone before you even noticed.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="what-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-tag">What Talon does</span>
    <h2>Not just data.<br/><em>Decisions.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Talon doesn't just track prices. It tells you what changed, why it changed, and what to do — in seconds.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="what-grid">
    <div class="what-item">
      <div class="what-num">01</div>
      <div class="what-title">What changed</div>
      <div class="what-desc">Competitor price movements detected the moment they happen — not hours later.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="what-item">
      <div class="what-num">02</div>
      <div class="what-title">Why it changed</div>
      <div class="what-desc">AI reasons through the signal — sale clearance, supply shock, seasonal shift — and explains it plainly.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="what-item">
      <div class="what-num">03</div>
      <div class="what-title">What to do next</div>
      <div class="what-desc">One clear action with the estimated dollar impact. No dashboards. No spreadsheets. No guessing.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="use-cases-section" style="background:var(--bg1)">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-tag">Use cases</span>
    <h2>Three ways stores <em>bleed money</em><br/>without knowing it.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="uc-list">
    <div class="uc-card">
      <div class="uc-left">
        <div class="uc-scenario">
          <strong>You're losing sales and don't know why.</strong>
          A competitor drops their price. You don't notice. You lose position. Customers pick them — not you.
        </div>
        <div class="uc-meta">
          <span>Detected in &lt; 60s</span>
          <span class="icp-div">·</span>
          <span>92% confidence</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-right">
        <div class="uc-sug-label">Talon detects</div>
        <div class="signal-row">
          <span class="signal-label">Price drop</span>
          <span class="signal-badge badge-r">−12%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-row">
          <span class="signal-label">Daily impact</span>
          <span class="signal-badge badge-r">−$320 / day</span>
        </div>
        <div class="uc-suggestion">
          <div class="uc-sug-label">Talon suggests</div>
          <div class="uc-sug-action" onclick="document.getElementById('analyzer').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Match price to recover lost sales <span>→</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="uc-card">
      <div class="uc-left">
        <div class="uc-scenario">
          <strong>You became the most expensive option.</strong>
          Your product is now +18% above the market. Customers compare — and leave. You never saw it happen.
        </div>
        <div class="uc-meta">
          <span>Detected in &lt; 60s</span>
          <span class="icp-div">·</span>
          <span>89% confidence</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-right">
        <div class="uc-sug-label">Talon detects</div>
        <div class="signal-row">
          <span class="signal-label">Market position</span>
          <span class="signal-badge badge-r">#2 → #5</span>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-row">
          <span class="signal-label">Price gap</span>
          <span class="signal-badge badge-r">+18% above market</span>
        </div>
        <div class="uc-suggestion">
          <div class="uc-sug-label">Talon suggests</div>
          <div class="uc-sug-action" onclick="document.getElementById('analyzer').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Adjust price to regain competitiveness <span>→</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="uc-card">
      <div class="uc-left">
        <div class="uc-scenario">
          <strong>Market shifts — and you leave money on the table.</strong>
          Competitors raise prices. Supply is tight. You stay put. You could have earned more — but you didn't know.
        </div>
        <div class="uc-meta">
          <span>Detected in &lt; 60s</span>
          <span class="icp-div">·</span>
          <span>85% confidence</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-right">
        <div class="uc-sug-label">Talon detects</div>
        <div class="signal-row">
          <span class="signal-label">Market shift</span>
          <span class="signal-badge badge-g">+8% upward</span>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-row">
          <span class="signal-label">Margin opportunity</span>
          <span class="signal-badge badge-g">+12% if you move</span>
        </div>
        <div class="uc-suggestion">
          <div class="uc-sug-label">Talon suggests</div>
          <div class="uc-sug-action" onclick="document.getElementById('analyzer').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Increase price while staying competitive <span>→</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="why-section section-textured">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-tag">Why Talon</span>
    <h2>Most tools show you data.<br/><em>Talon tells you what to do with it.</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="why-block">
    <div class="why-cell">
      <div class="why-cell-label">Other tools</div>
      <div class="why-cell-title muted">Here's a dashboard with 14 charts</div>
